        "words": 118,
        "preview": "While my husband and Mr. Henley were engaged in writing plays in Bournemouth they made a number of t"
      },
      {
        "reason": "before-first-heading",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 132,
        "preview": "As I wanted a trial scene in the Old Bailey, I chose the period of 1700 for my purpose; but being sh"
      },
      {
        "reason": "before-first-heading",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 30,
        "preview": "Occasionally other trials than those of the Old Bailey would be included in the package of books we "
      },
      {
        "reason": "before-first-heading",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 30,
