        "source_id": "",
        "words": 191,
        "preview": "A letter from James Stewart to Mr. John Macfarlane, introduced as evidence in the trial, says: “Ther"
      },
      {
        "reason": "before-first-heading",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 242,
        "preview": "There are many incidents given in the trial that point to Alan’s fiery spirit and Highland quickness"
      },
      {
        "reason": "before-first-heading",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 163,
        "preview": "Some time after the publication of Kidnapped we stopped for a short while in the Appin country, wher"
      },
      {
        "reason": "before-first-heading",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 96,
